    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/1ba9a56dbee4f9a70be0827b25b976ff.avif?t=1743759805\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your game characters to life with <strong>Retro Character Creator Tool</strong>. This easy-to-use tool lets you create 4-directional characters with a wide variety of hair styles, clothing options, and weapon choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Retro Character Creator Tool</strong> features a user-friendly interface, making it easy for even beginners to create unique and engaging characters for their game. The tool includes a vast library of assets, including hairstyles, clothing, and weapons, all designed in a charming pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/bc24495d6ebc17e379f6e1387826ae97.poster.avif?t=1743759805\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/bc24495d6ebc17e379f6e1387826ae97.webm?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/bc24495d6ebc17e379f6e1387826ae97.mp4?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Animations:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking: Natural movements to traverse your game world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle: Character stances that breathe life into moments of pause</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack: Strikes to combat your enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead: Static dead sprite for impactful in-game consequences</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Directions (Left, Right, Up, Down)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with Unity, Godot, GameMaker...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with RPG Maker (VX, MV &amp; MZ)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/b4ee7867e2c5d8426abedfdd53e50eed.poster.avif?t=1743759805\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/b4ee7867e2c5d8426abedfdd53e50eed.webm?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/b4ee7867e2c5d8426abedfdd53e50eed.mp4?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/5b14606f1d1808e26f50e5504c00aa85.webp?t=1743759805\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/71e9e809cb5f201637b2383c6870dcab.poster.avif?t=1743759805\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/71e9e809cb5f201637b2383c6870dcab.webm?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/71e9e809cb5f201637b2383