b_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/19590bcf0fbd1e1a64539b8d3876da7b.poster.avif?t=1743759805\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/19590bcf0fbd1e1a64539b8d3876da7b.webm?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291640/extras/19590bcf0fbd1e1a64539b8d3876da7b.mp4?t=1743759805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
